# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets
# Cholec80 is not redistributable (see THIRD_PARTY.md). Only the small
# pig-liver images used by the evaluation notebooks are tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/medical_deformed/
data/medical_deformed/*
!data/medical_deformed/pig_liver_to_elongate.png
!data/medical_deformed/pl_rest.png
