# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights
# Only the released Stretcher weights are tracked. Locally trained checkpoints
# and third-party detector/descriptor weights stay out of the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
models/*
!models/stretcher_superpoint.pth

